{"id":"the-bunny-band","slug":"the-bunny-band","title":"The Bunny Band","title_ko":"토끼 밴드","level":"A1","ageBand":"8-10","coverUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/cover.webp","summary_ko":"토끼 셋이 각자 악기를 들고 모여 숲속 작은 밴드를 만드는 이야기.","wordCount":82,"pages":[{"id":"the-bunny-band-p1","pageNo":1,"spread":"p1","imageUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/p1.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-bunny-band-p1-s1","ord":0,"text":"Benny the bunny played his drum alone.","translation_ko":"베니 토끼는 혼자 북을 쳤어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/audio/p1-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Benny","charStart":0,"charEnd":5,"startMs":0,"endMs":400},{"word":"the","charStart":6,"charEnd":9,"startMs":400,"endMs":660},{"word":"bunny","charStart":10,"charEnd":15,"startMs":660,"endMs":900},{"word":"played","charStart":16,"charEnd":22,"startMs":900,"endMs":1400},{"word":"his","charStart":23,"charEnd":26,"startMs":1400,"endMs":1680},{"word":"drum","charStart":27,"charEnd":31,"startMs":1680,"endMs":1960},{"word":"alone","charStart":32,"charEnd":37,"startMs":1960,"endMs":2560}]}]},{"id":"the-bunny-band-p2","pageNo":2,"spread":"p2","imageUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/p2.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-bunny-band-p2-s1","ord":0,"text":"He beat the drum and sang a little song.","translation_ko":"베니는 북을 치며 작은 노래를 불렀어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/audio/p2-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"He","charStart":0,"charEnd":2,"startMs":0,"endMs":580},{"word":"beat","charStart":3,"charEnd":7,"startMs":580,"endMs":780},{"word":"the","charStart":8,"charEnd":11,"startMs":780,"endMs":1260},{"word":"drum","charStart":12,"charEnd":16,"startMs":1260,"endMs":1260},{"word":"and","charStart":17,"charEnd":20,"startMs":1260,"endMs":1640},{"word":"sang","charStart":21,"charEnd":25,"startMs":1640,"endMs":1860},{"word":"a","charStart":26,"charEnd":27,"startMs":1860,"endMs":2060},{"word":"little","charStart":28,"charEnd":34,"startMs":2060,"endMs":2280},{"word":"song","charStart":35,"charEnd":39,"startMs":2280,"endMs":2560}]}]},{"id":"the-bunny-band-p3","pageNo":3,"spread":"p3","imageUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/p3.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-bunny-band-p3-s1","ord":0,"text":"Lily came along with her flute.","translation_ko":"릴리가 플루트를 들고 다가왔어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/audio/p3-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Lily","charStart":0,"charEnd":4,"startMs":0,"endMs":360},{"word":"came","charStart":5,"charEnd":9,"startMs":360,"endMs":720},{"word":"along","charStart":10,"charEnd":15,"startMs":720,"endMs":1040},{"word":"with","charStart":16,"charEnd":20,"startMs":1040,"endMs":1240},{"word":"her","charStart":21,"charEnd":24,"startMs":1240,"endMs":1460},{"word":"flute","charStart":25,"charEnd":30,"startMs":1460,"endMs":1660}]},{"id":"the-bunny-band-p3-s2","ord":1,"text":"\"Can I play too?\" she asked.","translation_ko":"\"나도 같이 해도 돼?\" 릴리가 물었어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/audio/p3-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Can","charStart":1,"charEnd":4,"startMs":0,"endMs":660},{"word":"I","charStart":5,"charEnd":6,"startMs":660,"endMs":940},{"word":"play","charStart":7,"charEnd":11,"startMs":940,"endMs":1140},{"word":"too","charStart":12,"charEnd":15,"startMs":1140,"endMs":2180},{"word":"she","charStart":18,"charEnd":21,"startMs":2180,"endMs":2340},{"word":"asked","charStart":22,"charEnd":27,"startMs":2340,"endMs":2700}]}]},{"id":"the-bunny-band-p4","pageNo":4,"spread":"p4","imageUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/p4.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-bunny-band-p4-s1","ord":0,"text":"\"Yes!\" said Benny, and they played together.","translation_ko":"\"그럼!\" 베니가 말하며 둘이 함께 연주했어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/audio/p4-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Yes","charStart":1,"charEnd":4,"startMs":0,"endMs":700},{"word":"said","charStart":7,"charEnd":11,"startMs":700,"endMs":1100},{"word":"Benny","charStart":12,"charEnd":17,"startMs":1100,"endMs":1340},{"word":"and","charStart":19,"charEnd":22,"startMs":1580,"endMs":1760},{"word":"they","charStart":23,"charEnd":27,"startMs":1760,"endMs":1920},{"word":"played","charStart":28,"charEnd":34,"startMs":1920,"endMs":2120},{"word":"together","charStart":35,"charEnd":43,"startMs":2120,"endMs":2580}]}]},{"id":"the-bunny-band-p5","pageNo":5,"spread":"p5","imageUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/p5.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-bunny-band-p5-s1","ord":0,"text":"The flute sang high and the drum beat low.","translation_ko":"플루트는 높게, 북은 낮게 울렸어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/audio/p5-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"The","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":340},{"word":"flute","charStart":4,"charEnd":9,"startMs":340,"endMs":620},{"word":"sang","charStart":10,"charEnd":14,"startMs":620,"endMs":1120},{"word":"high","charStart":15,"charEnd":19,"startMs":1120,"endMs":1460},{"word":"and","charStart":20,"charEnd":23,"startMs":1460,"endMs":1820},{"word":"the","charStart":24,"charEnd":27,"startMs":1820,"endMs":2280},{"word":"drum","charStart":28,"charEnd":32,"startMs":2280,"endMs":2280},{"word":"beat","charStart":33,"charEnd":37,"startMs":2280,"endMs":2660},{"word":"low","charStart":38,"charEnd":41,"startMs":2660,"endMs":3060}]}]},{"id":"the-bunny-band-p6","pageNo":6,"spread":"p6","imageUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/p6.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-bunny-band-p6-s1","ord":0,"text":"Then Pip hopped up with his shiny bells.","translation_ko":"그때 핍이 반짝이는 방울을 들고 깡충 뛰어왔어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/audio/p6-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Then","charStart":0,"charEnd":4,"startMs":0,"endMs":460},{"word":"Pip","charStart":5,"charEnd":8,"startMs":460,"endMs":860},{"word":"hopped","charStart":9,"charEnd":15,"startMs":860,"endMs":1280},{"word":"up","charStart":16,"charEnd":18,"startMs":1280,"endMs":1480},{"word":"with","charStart":19,"charEnd":23,"startMs":1480,"endMs":1660},{"word":"his","charStart":24,"charEnd":27,"startMs":1660,"endMs":1900},{"word":"shiny","charStart":28,"charEnd":33,"startMs":1900,"endMs":2200},{"word":"bells","charStart":34,"charEnd":39,"startMs":2200,"endMs":2620}]},{"id":"the-bunny-band-p6-s2","ord":1,"text":"\"I brought my bells!\" he said.","translation_ko":"\"저 방울 가져왔어요!\" 핍이 말했어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/audio/p6-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"I","charStart":1,"charEnd":2,"startMs":0,"endMs":260},{"word":"brought","charStart":3,"charEnd":10,"startMs":260,"endMs":500},{"word":"my","charStart":11,"charEnd":13,"startMs":500,"endMs":760},{"word":"bells","charStart":14,"charEnd":19,"startMs":760,"endMs":1400},{"word":"he","charStart":22,"charEnd":24,"startMs":1400,"endMs":1520},{"word":"said","charStart":25,"charEnd":29,"startMs":1520,"endMs":1820}]}]},{"id":"the-bunny-band-p7","pageNo":7,"spread":"p7","imageUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/p7.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-bunny-band-p7-s1","ord":0,"text":"Pip shook the bells and the music got louder.","translation_ko":"핍이 방울을 흔들자 음악이 더 크게 울렸어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/audio/p7-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Pip","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":380},{"word":"shook","charStart":4,"charEnd":9,"startMs":380,"endMs":880},{"word":"the","charStart":10,"charEnd":13,"startMs":880,"endMs":1060},{"word":"bells","charStart":14,"charEnd":19,"startMs":1060,"endMs":1380},{"word":"and","charStart":20,"charEnd":23,"startMs":1380,"endMs":1860},{"word":"the","charStart":24,"charEnd":27,"startMs":1860,"endMs":2140},{"word":"music","charStart":28,"charEnd":33,"startMs":2140,"endMs":2340},{"word":"got","charStart":34,"charEnd":37,"startMs":2340,"endMs":2680},{"word":"louder","charStart":38,"charEnd":44,"startMs":2680,"endMs":2980}]}]},{"id":"the-bunny-band-p8","pageNo":8,"spread":"p8","imageUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/p8.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-bunny-band-p8-s1","ord":0,"text":"The three bunnies made a beautiful song together.","translation_ko":"토끼 셋이 함께 아름다운 노래를 만들었어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/audio/p8-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"The","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":680},{"word":"three","charStart":4,"charEnd":9,"startMs":680,"endMs":1020},{"word":"bunnies","charStart":10,"charEnd":17,"startMs":1020,"endMs":1380},{"word":"made","charStart":18,"charEnd":22,"startMs":1380,"endMs":1820},{"word":"a","charStart":23,"charEnd":24,"startMs":1820,"endMs":2000},{"word":"beautiful","charStart":25,"charEnd":34,"startMs":2000,"endMs":2380},{"word":"song","charStart":35,"charEnd":39,"startMs":2380,"endMs":2740},{"word":"together","charStart":40,"charEnd":48,"startMs":2740,"endMs":3080}]}]},{"id":"the-bunny-band-p9","pageNo":9,"spread":"p9","imageUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/p9.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-bunny-band-p9-s1","ord":0,"text":"The whole forest danced and clapped along.","translation_ko":"온 숲이 노래에 맞춰 춤추고 박수를 쳤어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-bunny-band/audio/p9-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"The","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":640},{"word":"whole","charStart":4,"charEnd":9,"startMs":640,"endMs":1080},{"word":"forest","charStart":10,"charEnd":16,"startMs":1080,"endMs":1280},{"word":"danced","charStart":17,"charEnd":23,"startMs":1280,"endMs":1700},{"word":"and","charStart":24,"charEnd":27,"startMs":1700,"endMs":2280},{"word":"clapped","charStart":28,"charEnd":35,"startMs":2280,"endMs":2280},{"word":"along","charStart":36,"charEnd":41,"startMs":2280,"endMs":2640}]}]}],"quiz":[{"question_ko":"베니는 처음에 무슨 악기를 혼자 연주하고 있었나요?","type":"mc","options":["북","플루트","방울","피아노"],"answerIndex":0,"explain_ko":"베니는 혼자 북(drum)을 치고 있었어요.","id":"the-bunny-band-q1","ord":0},{"question_ko":"릴리는 어떤 악기를 가지고 왔나요?","type":"mc","options":["북","방울","플루트","기타"],"answerIndex":2,"explain_ko":"릴리는 플루트(flute)를 들고 베니에게 다가왔어요.","id":"the-bunny-band-q2","ord":1},{"question_ko":"세 번째로 합류한 토끼의 이름은 무엇인가요?","type":"mc","options":["베니","릴리","토미","핍"],"answerIndex":3,"explain_ko":"핍(Pip)이 방울을 들고 세 번째로 합류했어요.","id":"the-bunny-band-q3","ord":2},{"question_ko":"세 토끼가 함께 연주하자 숲에서는 어떤 일이 일어났나요?","type":"mc","options":["숲이 조용해졌어요.","숲속 동물들이 춤추고 박수를 쳤어요.","비가 내리기 시작했어요.","토끼들이 집으로 돌아갔어요."],"answerIndex":1,"explain_ko":"온 숲이 음악에 맞춰 춤추고 박수를 쳤어요.","id":"the-bunny-band-q4","ord":3},{"question_ko":"이 이야기의 주제는 무엇인가요?","type":"mc","options":["혼자 연습하는 것이 최고예요.","함께하면 더 아름다운 음악을 만들 수 있어요.","북이 가장 좋은 악기예요.","숲속에서는 뛰면 안 돼요."],"answerIndex":1,"explain_ko":"세 토끼가 힘을 합쳐 함께 연주했을 때 아름다운 음악과 행복한 숲이 만들어졌어요.","id":"the-bunny-band-q5","ord":4}]}